02:16:27.980 --> 02:16:29.498
and overloads those already

02:16:29.734 --> 02:16:30.468
doing the work.

02:16:30.468 --> 02:16:32.468
>> accordingly, this ordinance

02:16:33.771 --> 02:16:36.771
requires that by JUNE 30th 2026

02:16:37.420 --> 02:16:37.676
every district approve at least

02:16:37.676 --> 02:16:40.676
one new site a shelter

02:16:40.712 --> 02:16:41.380
transitional housing or

02:16:41.380 --> 02:16:43.380
behavioral health facility.

02:16:44.916 --> 02:16:45.650
>> it establishes 1000 foot

02:16:45.650 --> 02:16:48.650
buffer between new and existing

02:16:49.120 --> 02:16:49.888
sites to prevent clustering

02:16:49.888 --> 02:16:52.724
unless waived by the board for

02:16:52.724 --> 02:16:53.491
a compelling public interest.

02:16:53.491 --> 02:16:54.125
>> it also mandates twice a

02:16:54.125 --> 02:16:56.525
year public hearings the

02:16:56.562 --> 02:16:57.229
departments must report

02:16:57.229 --> 02:16:59.229
transparently on progress

02:17:00.650 --> 02:17:00.699
citing barriers and how many

02:17:00.699 --> 02:17:01.320
people are actually being

02:17:01.320 --> 02:17:03.320
served.

02:17:04.690 --> 02:17:04.836
>> our current structure is

02:17:04.836 --> 02:17:05.537
failing because it relies on a

02:17:05.537 --> 02:17:07.937
handful of neighborhoods to

02:17:08.600 --> 02:17:08.306
deliver care for an entire

02:17:08.306 --> 02:17:10.306
city.

02:17:11.811 --> 02:17:12.545
Over the last several months

02:17:12.545 --> 02:17:13.312
I've talked to our hot teams.

02:17:13.312 --> 02:17:13.612
I've talked to members of the

02:17:13.612 --> 02:17:15.612
board.

02:17:16.649 --> 02:17:17.383
i've talked members of the

02:17:17.383 --> 02:17:20.383
public and I've heard countless

02:17:20.952 --> 02:17:21.653
examples of residents who are

02:17:21.653 --> 02:17:22.200
in need in their respective

02:17:22.200 --> 02:17:22.654
districts.

02:17:22.654 --> 02:17:24.590
But because there was no

02:17:24.590 --> 02:17:25.224
shelter available, they were

02:17:25.224 --> 02:17:28.930
put out into the streets

02:17:28.930 --> 02:17:28.760
and some of them even

02:17:28.760 --> 02:17:30.760
unfortunately passed away.

02:17:32.980 --> 02:17:32.832
>> had services been available

02:17:32.832 --> 02:17:33.499
near them, their loss of life

02:17:33.499 --> 02:17:35.899
could have been entirely

02:17:36.302 --> 02:17:36.969
preventable.

02:17:36.969 --> 02:17:37.736
>> this failure in services

02:17:37.736 --> 02:17:40.390
doesn't just hurt communities

02:17:40.390 --> 02:17:40.739
