02:17:40.739 --> 02:17:43.139
individuals who can't access

02:17:43.776 --> 02:17:44.510
care, don't receive a bed or

02:17:44.510 --> 02:17:47.460
fall into cycles of crisis

02:17:47.460 --> 02:17:47.614
because our services aren't

02:17:47.614 --> 02:17:49.614
deployed where needed.

02:17:50.883 --> 02:17:51.184
>> these aren't statistics on a

02:17:51.184 --> 02:17:51.884
sheet.

02:17:51.884 --> 02:17:54.820
Is someone's friend a brother

02:17:54.820 --> 02:17:57.820
or sister or someone's child?

02:17:57.990 --> 02:17:58.724
>> this ordinance creates a

02:17:58.724 --> 02:17:59.392
functional citywide system of

02:17:59.392 --> 02:18:02.392
change one where people are

02:18:02.561 --> 02:18:03.329
housed faster services are

02:18:03.329 --> 02:18:06.329
closer to where people actually

02:18:06.766 --> 02:18:07.500
live and no one is left wasted

02:18:07.500 --> 02:18:09.836
waiting in line or out in the

02:18:09.836 --> 02:18:10.570
cold.

02:18:10.570 --> 02:18:11.204
