02:18:20.312 --> 02:18:20.980
and clear timelines.

02:18:20.980 --> 02:18:21.748
>> it codifies a minimum

02:18:21.748 --> 02:18:24.148
threshold of responsibility not

02:18:24.384 --> 02:18:24.918
just for this mayor or this

02:18:24.918 --> 02:18:27.318
board but for every

02:18:28.540 --> 02:18:28.855
