02:18:32.358 --> 02:18:32.925
but our responsibility for the

02:18:32.925 --> 02:18:33.660
betterment of current

02:18:33.660 --> 02:18:36.295
and future residents is written

02:18:36.295 --> 02:18:37.630
in this piece of legislation.

02:18:37.630 --> 02:18:40.630
>> it means residents in all

02:18:40.233 --> 02:18:40.901
neighborhoods north southeast

02:18:40.901 --> 02:18:41.602
and west can access shelter

02:18:41.602 --> 02:18:44.200
and behavioral health support

02:18:44.437 --> 02:18:45.138
without crossing the city,

02:18:45.138 --> 02:18:45.872
without feeling like they're

02:18:45.872 --> 02:18:47.774
leaving a piece of themselves

02:18:47.774 --> 02:18:48.341
where they grew up.

02:18:48.341 --> 02:18:48.975
>> it means residents

02:18:48.975 --> 02:18:51.375
in neighborhoods like the

02:18:52.312 --> 02:18:53.460
tenderloin and the bayview no

02:18:53.460 --> 02:18:55.815
longer bear the burden alone.

02:18:55.815 --> 02:18:56.549
It means better outcomes,

02:18:56.549 --> 02:18:58.949
faster placements, shorter wait

02:18:59.920 --> 02:19:00.487
lists and less burnout for

02:19:00.487 --> 02:19:01.540
front line providers

02:19:01.540 --> 02:19:03.540
and neighbors alike.

02:19:04.124 --> 02:19:04.858
>> this legislation is backed

02:19:04.858 --> 02:19:05.158
by those who know this system

02:19:05.158 --> 02:19:07.158
best.

02:19:08.462 --> 02:19:09.129
Tenderloin leaders, housing

02:19:09.129 --> 02:19:11.129
advocates, service providers

02:19:12.432 --> 02:19:13.199
and residents.

02:19:13.199 --> 02:19:15.736
And before I close I want to

02:19:15.736 --> 02:19:16.370
thank the tenderloin community

02:19:16.370 --> 02:19:17.104
our residents, advocates

02:19:17.104 --> 02:19:19.974
