02:19:28.281 --> 02:19:30.584
I want to thank my coauthor

02:19:30.584 --> 02:19:31.284
supervisor sherman alton walton

02:19:31.284 --> 02:19:32.860
for his leadership in this

02:19:32.860 --> 02:19:34.689
early on this earlier this year

02:19:34.689 --> 02:19:35.323
with geographic equity

02:19:35.323 --> 02:19:36.900
resolution and for being a

02:19:36.900 --> 02:19:38.826
partner in this important work.

02:19:38.826 --> 02:19:39.560
I'm grateful to our early

02:19:39.560 --> 02:19:41.560
