02:20:07.822 --> 02:20:10.222
similar efforts on this

02:20:10.692 --> 02:20:11.226
legislation and have endorsed

02:20:11.226 --> 02:20:11.959
this plan as well.

02:20:11.959 --> 02:20:13.959
>> colleagues, this legislation

02:20:15.163 --> 02:20:15.863
was written as a commitment to

02:20:15.863 --> 02:20:16.564
treating all residents with

02:20:16.564 --> 02:20:19.564
